"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5277920","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3909340-1846651706688412","game_id":"steam-3909340","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Update","summary":"We've got a new update ready for Steam Next Fest! Here's what's changed:Redesigned the demo's boss fight from the ground up, making better use of the game's mechanics.Added new VFX for shooting and parrying to make combat feel more satisfying.Added a new animation to the slow motion meter UI so it's easier to tell when it's ready to use.Shortened the parry window to make parrying more challenging and precise.Added a very small cooldown after parrying to prevent parry spamming.Made several contro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T01:02:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688412","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3909340-1846018067938119","game_id":"steam-3909340","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes (10/10)","summary":"Patch Notes:Adjusted dash movement based on player feedback.Added the global top 50 leaderboard! You can now see your own rank and the top 50 players worldwide.Fixed various bugs and made some general improvements and optimizations.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T10:01:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938119","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3909340-1845383656376856","game_id":"steam-3909340","kind":"update","title":"UPDATE #1","summary":"The first update for the demo is here! I’ve been listening to your feedback since launch, and I’ve made a number of changes that should help make the game feel better to play.Thank you so much for all the feedback, suggestions, and bug reports. I really appreciate everyone taking the time to share their thoughts and helping make the game better.For Nora is still a work in progress, and I’ll continue to release regular updates based on your feedback. But for now, here are the first patch notes: T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T09:16:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376856","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3909340-1844751498224287","game_id":"steam-3909340","kind":"announcement","title":"THE DEMO IS FINALLY OUT!","summary":"The For Nora demo is finally out, and the response has been way better than I could have imagined.70 reviews in less than 24 hours at very positive!!!So I wanted to thank each and every one of you for checking out For Nora. I’ll do everything in my power to make sure the game lives up to the hype.so, what now?There will be an update in a few days that addresses two of the biggest complaints about the demo:the parry timing window will be reduced to make it more challenging.some levels will be fin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T11:56:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224287","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3909340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3909340":"2026-10-26T11:02:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3909340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:22Z","st